name: sim.computeJacobian
description: Computes the Jacobian of a registered IK group. The result can then be read via sim.getIkGroupMatrix.
luaSynopsis: sim.computeJacobian(int ikGroupHandle,int options)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. ikGroupHandle: handle of the IK group. See also simGetIkGroupHandle.
2. options: bit-coded:
3. bit0 set (1): the joint IK weights are taken into account.
4. reserved: reserved for future extensions. Set to nullptr.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
